          volatile (Na/K) emission or melt physics.
    3  Y   first_yield              3.750    40.98   7.997e+08  physical
          Loading rho v^2 reaches S0 = 1.5 MPa. The body starts to flatten (pancake): area, drag and
          heating all grow, so the light rises faster. Analogue of the onset of fragmentation (Phase 5
          / H_f in [R22]).
